Fixture tree for the T12 upstream-patch seam.

These are VERBATIM COPIES of upstream files, not adaptations. They are byte
identical to what `omarchy-dev` installs under /usr/share/omarchy, which is the
only reason the tests are worth anything: a hand-written approximation of the
context lines would let a patch pass here and reject on the device.

